In `@test/services/foreground_service_test.dart` around lines 46 - 56, The mock
flips isRunning unconditionally in startService and stopService which can hide
failure-path bugs; update startService and stopService so they only set
isRunning = true when startResult indicates success and only set isRunning =
false when stopResult indicates success (use the mock's startResult and
stopResult values to decide), leaving isRunning unchanged on failure; adjust
assignments that reference lastServiceTypes/lastNotificationIcon similarly only
after a successful start.
